Compilation of the FEAST library source code:
----------------------------------------------

- You are currently in the directory $FEASTROOT/src

- Edit the "make.inc" file and change appropriately the name/path of the Fortran90 and C compilers.
  Remark: In contrast to the pre-compiled libraries, both compilers are needed to compile the source code.

- Execute: "make ARCH=<arch> all
 where <arch> is your selected name for your architecture; your FEAST libraries
will then be created in directory $FEASTROOT/lib/<arch>

- If you have successfully created your FEAST library for your own architecture not currently listed 
in the FEAST documentation, I will be pleased to receive these files by-email "feastsolver@gmail.com" in order to add them to the list of pre-compiled libraries.
